DM: Yeah

01:30:26.510 --> 01:30:27.990
Wellby: ... three maps in particular, though.

01:30:28.070 --> 01:30:29.310
DM: Okay. Well, we'll...

01:30:29.310 --> 01:30:30.430
DM: Wait, we'll, we'll come back to you.

01:30:30.450 --> 01:30:30.510
Wellby: Do... Okay. Yeah.

01:30:30.510 --> 01:30:30.850
DM: I want to

01:30:31.870 --> 01:30:33.070
DM: bounce around a little bit.

01:30:33.070 --> 01:30:33.230
Unknown: Good.

01:30:33.230 --> 01:30:33.690
DM: Kenzo,

01:30:35.090 --> 01:30:35.270
DM: um,

01:30:36.130 --> 01:30:39.130
DM: just following your instinct and the sort of, um,

01:30:42.050 --> 01:30:42.190
DM: uh,

01:30:45.210 --> 01:30:47.050
DM: the rumors you've heard, just, like, kind of,

01:30:48.230 --> 01:30:52.890
