01:30:59.390 --> 01:30:59.790
DM: Yeah.

01:30:59.810 --> 01:31:01.090
Kenzo: I just ask them where did they...

01:31:01.090 --> 01:31:02.530
Kenzo: You know, you know, just ask around.

01:31:02.810 --> 01:31:04.650
DM: Yeah, I mean, there's, there's...

01:31:04.650 --> 01:31:06.810
DM: You do see people on the street with tattoos.

01:31:06.810 --> 01:31:09.230
DM: Your... I mean, yours are pretty good.

01:31:09.230 --> 01:31:09.470
DM: Um,

01:31:10.950 --> 01:31:11.910
DM: you find yourself-

01:31:11.970 --> 01:31:14.270
Kenzo: Dude, my, mine are, mine are done by a fucking lizard folk.

01:31:14.270 --> 01:31:14.910
Kenzo: Mine are, like, amazing.

01:31:14.910 --> 01:31:16.770
DM: Yeah, yeah, that's true. Yours are quite good.

01:31:16.850 --> 01:31:17.710
Kenzo: Mine are, like, amazing.

01:31:18.570 --> 01:31:20.170
