01:31:20.250 --> 01:31:26.470
DM: Right. Um, the, the Tollen ones tend to be, like, this really bright, vivid colors.

01:31:26.550 --> 01:31:27.410
Kenzo: Yeah.

01:31:27.410 --> 01:31:27.610
DM: Um,

01:31:30.170 --> 01:31:30.450
DM: you,

01:31:31.570 --> 01:31:31.750
DM: uh,

01:31:34.230 --> 01:31:39.530
DM: find your, you find your way across the bridge into this Southbridge neighborhood.

01:31:40.190 --> 01:31:42.750
DM: Um, and there's, there's a, there's a, um,

01:31:43.790 --> 01:31:47.558
DM: a street basically, Inkwright Street.

01:31:47.558 --> 01:31:57.778
DM: Um, that runs just from the southern edge of the bridge and, um, basically everybody has pointed you to, um, your, both your intuition

01:31:57.778 --> 01:32:02.598
DM: and your, and your sort of rumor gathering has pointed you towards, um,

01:32:04.298 --> 01:32:11.778
DM: the shop of Cecilia Lister who is the, like, supposedly the mo- among the more renowned tattoo-

01:32:12.278 --> 01:32:12.958
DM: Nice

01:32:12.958 --> 01:32:14.998
