01:32:25.418 --> 01:32:25.778
Wellby: Cool.

01:32:25.798 --> 01:32:26.618
Delwath: Hmm.

01:32:26.638 --> 01:32:27.838
Kenzo: Wow. I like that.

01:32:27.898 --> 01:32:28.098
DM: Um...

01:32:29.478 --> 01:32:30.138
Kenzo: I go to her shop.

01:32:32.578 --> 01:32:33.918
Kenzo: I've also got the tattoo needle.

01:32:36.158 --> 01:32:41.058
Kenzo: That- that's a, that's a, like, you do it and then tattoo appears, and then you can, you can, you can, like, suck it up and you-

