01:32:43.598 --> 01:32:43.998
Kenzo: Nice.

01:32:44.958 --> 01:32:45.138
DM: Um,

01:32:47.318 --> 01:32:51.397
DM: so you enter, her shop is this small, um-

01:32:51.418 --> 01:32:53.158
Kenzo: You made a tattoo shop, that's so great.

01:32:53.158 --> 01:32:54.018
Delwath: [laughs]

01:32:54.098 --> 01:32:55.178
DM: Ah, no, this is her.

01:32:55.178 --> 01:32:55.318
Unknown: Right.

01:32:55.338 --> 01:32:59.318
