Wellby: up.

01:33:14.958 --> 01:33:15.358
Delwath: Right, right.

01:33:15.418 --> 01:33:16.898
Kenzo: More than I know what a person looks like.

01:33:17.258 --> 01:33:17.978
Delwath: Hmm.

01:33:19.118 --> 01:33:19.198
DM: Yeah.

01:33:19.198 --> 01:33:20.918
Delwath: So you can get, it does better with vibes, right?

01:33:20.918 --> 01:33:20.938
Delwath: Hmm.

01:33:20.938 --> 01:33:24.598
Delwath: If you give it vibes for a person, they come out pretty well.

01:33:25.758 --> 01:33:27.058
DM: So she looks up at you.

01:33:27.698 --> 01:33:30.798
Kenzo: She looks like, um, she [laughs] looks like, uh,

01:33:34.078 --> 01:33:36.698
Unknown: uh, uh... Who's that fucking Asian? I don't know, but she looks like Michelle Yeoh.

01:33:37.358 --> 01:33:41.498
DM: Yeah. [laughs]

01:33:41.498 --> 01:33:42.978
Delwath: [laughs]

01:33:42.978 --> 01:33:43.138
DM: [coughs] Um...

01:33:43.138 --> 01:33:43.478
Seeker: A little bit

01:33:44.618 --> 01:33:47.438
DM: ... uh, her shop is this, like, like,

01:33:48.878 --> 01:33:53.158
DM: um, there- there's like an entryway that's sort of a cramped, um,

01:33:54.338 --> 01:34:01.258
DM: uh, there's like a curtain across so you, like, enter the door and then there's this, like, little area with a curtain across.

01:34:01.258 --> 01:34:04.898
DM: Um, you sort of cautiously, um,

01:34:06.478 --> 01:34:09.878
DM: poke, poke your, your head in, and she looks up

01:34:11.018 --> 01:34:18.658
DM: at you and she, um, she's not, like, you can see that she's currently in the middle of, like, organizing these inks, and she has this, like-

01:34:18.718 --> 01:34:19.078
Delwath: Nice, nice

01:34:19.078 --> 01:34:25.178
DM: ... row of, like, 40 different little vials, like, all arranged very precisely, neat.

01:34:25.178 --> 01:34:28.918
DM: Shop is super neat. Like, everything is, like, carefully...

