Unknown: "Can I help you?"

01:34:34.198 --> 01:34:44.618
Kenzo: Kenzo kind of just looks at her and then, like, pulls, pulls his arm down to kind of reveal the Motua, and then kind of

01:34:44.618 --> 01:34:50.598
Kenzo: sh- like, pulls, pulls his, uh, robe over to show the top of the, the jaguar that's kind of snaking down his back.

01:34:53.218 --> 01:34:57.058
DM: She, like, looks at you carefully for a moment, reaches out her hand.

01:34:57.058 --> 01:34:59.298
DM: "Lizardfolk work.

01:34:59.318 --> 01:35:00.458
DM: I don't see that often here."

01:35:01.938 --> 01:35:03.638
Kenzo: I've heard you're the finest artisan in town.

01:35:05.438 --> 01:35:06.158
DM: That's true.

01:35:07.558 --> 01:35:07.698
DM: For you.

01:35:07.698 --> 01:35:09.938
Unknown: I'd love to, I'd love to do some work with you.

01:35:11.578 --> 01:35:17.398
Kenzo: I'm interested not only in your creative expression, but I also hear that you've got some special inks.

01:35:19.218 --> 01:35:19.658
DM: I do.

01:35:20.518 --> 01:35:21.378
Kenzo: I'd love to learn more.

01:35:25.718 --> 01:35:27.078
DM: Where did you get that tattoo?

01:35:28.078 --> 01:35:29.918
DM: Not, I've not seen that.

01:35:31.118 --> 01:35:31.498
DM: You recognize it?

01:35:31.498 --> 01:35:33.918
DM: I knew all the lizardfolk tattoo artists in the city.

01:35:35.038 --> 01:35:40.398
Kenzo: Oh, these are lizard- lizardfolk tattoo artists probably about 4,000 miles from here.

01:35:40.398 --> 01:35:44.978
DM: [laughs] That is not something I hear every day.

01:35:46.658 --> 01:35:48.718
Kenzo: I wouldn't have known about it either a few months ago,

01:35:50.338 --> 01:35:50.438
Unknown: but.

01:35:50.438 --> 01:35:52.558
DM: What were you thinking?

01:35:52.558 --> 01:35:53.258
Kenzo: A couple things.

01:35:54.418 --> 01:35:56.738
Kenzo: One, I think it would be amazing to, uh,

01:35:57.538 --> 01:36:00.178
Unknown: add a little bit of an, an, of your creative embellishment.

01:36:00.218 --> 01:36:01.198
Kenzo: Your work looks amazing.

01:36:02.258 --> 01:36:07.798
Kenzo: Um, and then also, uh, to my, I've got my staff with me, so

01:36:10.958 --> 01:36:13.178
Kenzo: the staff has on the top, right?

01:36:13.198 --> 01:36:15.458
Kenzo: The different, um, the different, um,

01:36:17.498 --> 01:36:18.538
Delwath: uh, uh-

