03:12:52.032 --> 03:12:53.692
Unknown: You never know, Delwath.

03:12:53.692 --> 03:12:54.212
Kenzo: Number one,

03:12:55.292 --> 03:12:55.652
Kenzo: I think

03:12:56.592 --> 03:13:00.632
