03:13:04.672 --> 03:13:05.632
Kenzo: You... Okay.

03:13:06.872 --> 03:13:14.312
Kenzo: Yes, it was rare that you, an elf, ended up trapped in an extra dimensional, an extra dimensional space for several hundred years.

03:13:14.372 --> 03:13:14.672
Delwath: Mm-hmm.

03:13:15.272 --> 03:13:19.032
