03:14:59.992 --> 03:15:00.292
Delwath: and,

03:15:01.552 --> 03:15:05.532
DM: um, gracefully swings open as, as you approach.

03:15:06.212 --> 03:15:06.452
Delwath: Um,

03:15:07.592 --> 03:15:07.852
Delwath: and a,

03:15:09.332 --> 03:15:09.372
Delwath: a...

03:15:11.752 --> 03:15:12.692
