03:16:25.462 --> 03:16:25.722
Delwath: Right

03:16:25.722 --> 03:16:25.722
DM: ...

03:16:27.142 --> 03:16:28.642
DM: no, not powerful.

03:16:28.662 --> 03:16:28.902
Delwath: Okay.

03:16:30.462 --> 03:16:34.302
DM: Sort of gives you a slight bow and he says, "Welcome to my home.

03:16:34.302 --> 03:16:35.702
DM: It is my pleasure to greet you."

03:16:36.262 --> 03:16:36.662
DM: Sort of

03:16:37.762 --> 03:16:41.142
DM: motions for you to come in, a- and your companions as well.

03:16:41.142 --> 03:16:41.562
DM: "It is

03:16:43.022 --> 03:16:44.962
