03:18:01.722 --> 03:18:05.762
Unknown: [laughs] Um, solving the Skaer curse.

03:18:09.062 --> 03:18:13.262
Delwath: Delwath looks, like, perks up at that for a minute and, um,

03:18:15.222 --> 03:18:20.342
