03:18:21.502 --> 03:18:23.542
Delwath: um, I came just to

03:18:25.082 --> 03:18:26.502
Delwath: introduce myself and

03:18:28.082 --> 03:18:30.142
Delwath: ask for some news of the last

03:18:31.482 --> 03:18:32.302
Delwath: 200 years.

03:18:32.302 --> 03:18:39.542
Unknown: [laughs] Right after he says, "I'm super busy.

03:18:39.542 --> 03:18:41.062
