03:18:42.642 --> 03:18:45.962
Delwath: Brief news.

03:18:45.962 --> 03:18:47.022
DM: Where are you from?

03:18:47.702 --> 03:18:49.582
Unknown: I forget where El- Delwath is from.

03:18:49.582 --> 03:18:51.302
Unknown: Did we ever make up an... He made up a name, right?

03:18:51.322 --> 03:18:51.362
DM: Yeah.

03:18:51.362 --> 03:18:52.102
Delwath: What was it? Do you

03:18:53.162 --> 03:18:53.582
