03:22:31.322 --> 03:22:31.502
DM: Perhaps so.

03:22:31.502 --> 03:22:32.922
Delwath: Or is it more than usual?

03:22:38.182 --> 03:22:38.602
DM: She

03:22:41.982 --> 03:22:42.922
DM: knows much,

03:22:47.782 --> 03:22:48.622
