03:23:13.362 --> 03:23:14.082
Delwath: That's good to know.

03:23:17.382 --> 03:23:17.722
Delwath: These

03:23:19.062 --> 03:23:20.322
Delwath: Skaer, you said they're...

03:23:22.882 --> 03:23:22.942
Delwath: I,

03:23:24.782 --> 03:23:25.322
Delwath: I don't think

