03:23:29.682 --> 03:23:31.602
Unknown: all of the troubles to the south and

03:23:33.162 --> 03:23:34.262
Delwath: all of the, uh...

03:23:35.862 --> 03:23:37.522
Delwath: Can I, do I have any sense of how old he is?

03:23:38.702 --> 03:23:40.222
DM: Older than you.

03:23:40.222 --> 03:23:41.462
Delwath: Like, by a fair bit or?

03:23:41.722 --> 03:23:42.182
DM: Mm,

03:23:43.102 --> 03:23:46.882
DM: probably a f- two or, like, a few generations.

03:23:46.882 --> 03:23:48.902
DM: Not like it's super elder, but like...

03:23:51.122 --> 03:23:52.902
Unknown: Are there any in Orenlas

