DM: You, you have never been to Orenlas.

03:24:05.662 --> 03:24:08.642
Delwath: No.

03:24:08.642 --> 03:24:10.702
DM: There are some in Orenlas

03:24:12.842 --> 03:24:13.622
DM: who remember,

03:24:16.102 --> 03:24:20.322
